abstract: "Public computational reproducibility materials supporting the manuscript Vertex Eccentricity Labeled Energy for Power-Grid Vulnerability Screening with DC-Flow Validation. The v1.0.0-submission release contains the frozen public-safe staged code, machine-readable outputs, executable MATPOWER 8.1/GNU Octave validation evidence, benchmark provenance, technical documentation and integrity checks. The submitted manuscript PDF/source and journal-submission files are intentionally excluded from the public release during peer review."
